    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Announcement</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/645530/extras/eee32022c2292196f17f2984cd7df7b1.avif?t=1748359314\" /></div><strong>Raise The Dead Returns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you all for your interest in Raise The Dead! This game was a dream project of mine for a long time, an idea I always wanted to get back to one day in some way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please see the news section for more details. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you and stay tuned!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Raise The Dead is a zombie experimentation game. Perform research and experiments on zombies. Craft potions. Grow various plants and upgrade your equipment. Your ultimate goal is to find a cure to the zombie outbreak.",
